@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmRinging
state AlarmStopped
state LightOn
state LightOff

StartWatch --> HourAdjustment [*]
HourAdjustment --> MinuteAdjustment
MinuteAdjustment --> AlarmHourAdjustment
AlarmHourAdjustment --> AlarmMinuteAdjustment
AlarmMinuteAdjustment --> AlarmRinging
AlarmRinging --> AlarmStopped
LightOn --> LightOff

state EndWatch [*]
EndWatch --> StartWatch

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online College Magazine System

state StartLogin
state AdminProfileManagement
state ArticleReview
state ContentCreation
state Editing
state AccessDenied
state ReadingArticles
state SearchingArticles
state FeedbackProvided
state Logout

StartLogin --> [*] AdminProfileManagement
AdminProfileManagement --> ContentCreation
ContentCreation --> Editing
Editing --> ArticleReview
ArticleReview --> Publishing
Publishing --> ReadingArticles
ReadingArticles --> SearchingArticles
SearchingArticles --> FeedbackProvided
FeedbackProvided --> Logout
Logout --> [*] AccessDenied
AccessDenied --> [*] StartLogin

title UML State Machine Diagram - Smart Traffic Management System

state TrafficMonitoring
state StreetLightControl
state TrafficSignalManagement
state VehicleNumberCapture
state TrafficRuleVerification
state NoViolation
state ViolationRecorded
state FinePaid
state WarningSent

TrafficMonitoring --> StreetLightControl
StreetLightControl --> TrafficSignalManagement
TrafficSignalManagement --> VehicleNumberCapture
VehicleNumberCapture --> TrafficRuleVerification
TrafficRuleVerification --> NoViolation
NoViolation --> TrafficMonitoring
TrafficRuleVerification --> ViolationRecorded
ViolationRecorded --> FinePaid
FinePaid --> TrafficMonitoring
ViolationRecorded --> WarningSent

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online Marketplace

state Registration
state Verification
state SellerWorkspace
state ProductAddition
state ProductPromotion
state CustomerDashboard
state ProductExploration
state ProductViewing
state Purchase
state Logout

Registration --> Verification [*]
Verification --> SellerWorkspace
SellerWorkspace --> ProductAddition
ProductAddition --> ProductPromotion
ProductPromotion --> CustomerDashboard
CustomerDashboard --> ProductExploration
ProductExploration --> ProductViewing
ProductViewing --> Purchase
Purchase --> Logout
Logout --> [*] LogoutEnd
LogoutEnd --> Registration
@enduml
